DESCRIPTION:<p>Dear Team\,<br>As start of new year\, we are continuing our 
 division of MVPs to build viable Product Ideas in house.</p><p>There are tw
 o life cycles\, one is MVP and second is actual GTM. We are evolving with p
 rocess for GTM\, for what we have as MVPs now.</p><p>So\, now we are lookin
 g for more MVPs to take care of in current year. This is an initiative whic
 h invites all ignited minds to come prepare your ideas and thoughts around 
 the same.</p><p>Brainstorming often becomes random idea dumping instead of 
 strategic exploration. Here are <strong>practical readiness pointers</stron
 g> so the discussion is sharp\, relevant\, and outcome-driven:</p><p></p><u
 l><li><em>What problem do you want to solve?</em> not <em>What solution can
  we build?</em></li><li><em>Which industry do I understand well enough to b
 uild for? Like Manufacturing\, Supply Chain\, Logistics\, retail etc.</em><
 /li><li>Does something like this already exist? If yes\, what’s missing in 
 current solutions?</li><li>Tangible Value:  Does it save time? Reduce error
 s? Improve visibility Help management decision-making?</li></ul><br>If you 
 have something and wish to share\, then come prepared and we would LOVE to 
 hear you.<br><br><br>Thank You.\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
